# Per-board repo version overrides for jetson-agx-thor.
#
# Sourced by bootstrap.sh after the default URL_*/SRCREV_* values are set
# (from scripts/upstream-repos.env), but before the repos[] array is built.
#
# Thor was the canary for moving every Jetson board onto JetPack 7.2 / L4T
# R39.2.0. That line is the first to support Thor and the Orin family at once
# (see meta-tegra's docs/release-notes/JetPack-7.2-L4T-R39.2.0-Notes.md) and the
# first to declare LAYERSERIES_COMPAT = "blacksail", the in-development series
# after wrynose (6.0). The rest of the fleet followed, so every pin now comes
# from the shared blacksail set in scripts/upstream-repos.env and nothing here
# needs to differ.
#
# WENDYOS_LAYER_TREE="blacksail" makes bootstrap.sh clone every upstream repo
# under repos/blacksail/, parallel to repos/wrynose/ — the validated r38.4 /
# JP7.1 Thor fallback tree. Switching trees never touches the other one.
WENDYOS_LAYER_TREE="blacksail"
